P actions make_etude
P memjob 1048576
P memory_limit 1000.0
P mode interactif
P nomjob AsterModal
P version stable
A memjeveux 128.0
A args -max_base 300000
A tpmax 9000.0
F comm AsterModalparam.in D 1
F comm AsterModal.comm D  1
F comm AsterModalPostPro.comm D 1
F mess AsterModal.log R  6
F mmed AsterModalinput.med D  20
F rmed AsterModaloutput.rmed R  80
F resu AsterModal.resu R 8
F libr AsterModal_objective.csv R  27
